{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall Town wonders is a cosy life sim where you build a charming town from the ground up, guide quirky characters through delightful quests, and customize every detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, build, and fall in love with your town like never before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dating feature added: choose how you let your Towns Folk date!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/529ba4f3b4bcaab7efa6ae6ec3293cb1.poster.avif?t=1765795518\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/529ba4f3b4bcaab7efa6ae6ec3293cb1.webm?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/529ba4f3b4bcaab7efa6ae6ec3293cb1.mp4?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Virtual reality cosy life sim city builder:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world where you will experience MR like never before, with unique interactions and highly detailed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/2f09f0bf8159a1b4f579cf2bcd003038.poster.avif?t=1765795518\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/2f09f0bf8159a1b4f579cf2bcd003038.webm?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/2f09f0bf8159a1b4f579cf2bcd003038.mp4?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gentle and Relaxing Gameplay:</